# What the Signer (apps/signer) reads and shows before any key is loaded:
# Electrum's QR codes of transactions, through the simulated camera. The codes are Electrum's own to_qr_data() output
# (tests/psbt/electrum_made.json, made by tests/psbt/make_electrum_psbts.py
# from the BIP-39 test mnemonic "abandon ... about": test coins only).
# Warning counts vary: without gk:crypto's ripemd160 (older systems) the
# summary adds a note that some keys were not checked.
# Made from tests/psbt/signer_read.txt.in by tests/psbt/make_scenario.py.
expect launcher ready 60
launch signer
expect signer ready 10
wait 0.5
shot 01-home

# 1. A testnet P2WPKH payment with change (Electrum: 600000 sat out, 1500 fee)
key ret
mark
camera qr @testnet-p2wpkh-change@
expect signer: read a PSBT \(base43, 412 characters, \d+ bytes\) 20
expect signer: totals: sent 600000 sat, change 398500 sat, fee 1500 sat, 141 vB, testnet 10
camera scene
wait 0.5
shot 02-summary
# arrows go through the rows; Enter opens one, Escape closes it
key down down
key ret
wait 0.5
shot 03-output-details
key esc
# the network button: up to the first row, Shift+Tab twice to it (Home,
# Network); Enter cycles mainnet, testnet, regtest
key up up up up up up
key shift-tab shift-tab
key ret
expect signer: review: .*, regtest, \d+ warnings? 5
wait 0.5
shot 04-regtest

# 2. Not a transaction, and a payment request: refused, the scanner goes on
key esc
key ret
mark
camera qr hello, air gap
expect signer: refused a code: This code is not a transaction 20
mark
camera qr bitcoin:tb1qw508d6qejxtdg4y5r3zarvary0c5xw7kxpjzsx?amount=0.001
expect signer: refused a code: This is a payment request 20
wait 0.5
shot 05-refused

# 3. A P2PKH wallet: the QR code leaves out the previous transaction
mark
camera qr @testnet-p2pkh@
expect signer: totals: sent 100000 sat, change 197700 sat, fee 2300 sat, 223 vB, testnet 20
expect signer: warn: Input 1: only the spent output is given 5
camera scene
wait 0.5
shot 06-p2pkh-warning

# 4. 2-of-3 multisig, then mainnet with two payments
key esc
wait 0.3
key ret
mark
camera qr @testnet-2of3-p2wsh@
expect signer: totals: sent 300000 sat, change 498000 sat, fee 2000 sat, 189 vB, testnet 20
camera scene
key esc
wait 0.3
key ret
mark
camera qr @mainnet-p2wpkh-two-payments@
expect signer: totals: sent 1434567 sat, change 3562613 sat, fee 2820 sat, 173 vB, mainnet 20
camera scene
wait 0.5
shot 07-mainnet

# 5. The first one, signed by Electrum: a complete transaction. It says
# nothing of its network: the last one chosen or guessed is kept
key esc
wait 0.3
key ret
mark
camera qr @testnet-p2wpkh-signed@
expect signer: read a finished transaction \(base43, 327 characters 20
expect signer: totals: sent 998500 sat, change 0 sat, fee \? sat, 141 vB, mainnet 5
camera scene
wait 0.5
shot 08-signed

# 6. A large one: 13 inputs, 2821 characters (the simulated camera makes
# byte-mode codes, 2953 characters at most; Electrum's alphanumeric codes
# hold up to 4296)
key esc
wait 0.3
key ret
mark
camera qr @testnet-13-inputs@
expect signer: read a PSBT \(base43, 2821 characters, \d+ bytes\) 30
expect signer: totals: sent 120000 sat, change 7000 sat, fee 3078 sat, 957 vB, testnet 10
camera scene
wait 0.5
shot 09-many-inputs
key meta_l
expect launcher ready
